; XSparkFlow - XAUUSD M30 CandleFlow starting point
;
; For XSparkFlow.ex5 on an XAUUSD M30 chart. This is a STARTING POINT, not a
; validated profile: CandleFlow has never been backtested, forward-tested or
; traded. Nothing here is a profitability claim.
;
; The rule it configures: when the M30 candle closes above its open, buy; below
; its open, sell. No take-profit. The stop sits 0.10 x average range beyond that
; candle's far wick, and re-anchors to the far wick of every later closed M30
; candle, tightening only.
;
; TO CHANGE TIMEFRAME: attach the EA to a different chart period. Every distance
; here is a multiple of that period's own average range, so nothing in this file
; needs editing. Supported periods: M1, M5, M15, M30, H1, H2, H4.
;
; Risk starts at 1% per trade with trading DISABLED. Set InpEnableTrading=true
; only after a Strategy Tester run and a demo account have shown you what this
; rule actually does - it is in the market far more often than ScoreBot_v3.

InpEnableTrading=false
InpAutoTuneForSymbol=true
InpMaxOpenTrades=1

InpBufferATRMult=0.10
InpBufferRangePct=0.0
InpBufferPoints=0.0
InpMinStopATRMult=0.25
InpMaxStopATRMult=0.0
InpMinBodyATRMult=0.0
InpUseVolatilityGate=false

InpRiskPct=1.0
InpMaxRiskPct=3.5
InpMaxAccountRiskPct=6.0
InpMaxDailyDDPct=15.0
InpUseTotalDDKillSwitch=true
InpMaxTotalDDPct=25.0

InpUseWeekendClose=true
InpWeekendCloseHour=20
InpWeekendCloseMinute=0

InpVerboseLog=false

InpQuietMarketPct=60.0
InpWildMarketPct=600.0
InpEntrySlipPct=25.0
InpExitSlipPct=85.0
InpSpreadCapPct=40.0
InpMaxSpreadATRPct=10.0

InpUseSpreadFilter=true
InpUseStopLevelValidation=true
InpUseMarginCheck=true
InpMarginBufferPct=20.0
InpMaxQuoteAgeSeconds=15

InpMagicNumber=770332
InpOrderComment=CandleFlow_v1
InpClearKillswitchLatch=false
